# Optional configuration for the PFP Paper 003 candidate-response demo.
#
# The demo is offline by default and makes no network request. A single request
# to OpenRouter is made only with:
#
#   py -3.12 code/live_proposer_demo.py --live
#
# The key is read from the OPENROUTER_API_KEY environment variable, or from a
# file you name explicitly with --env-file (for example a copy of this file).
# No .env file is read implicitly, and the key is never printed.
#
# Never add a real key to this example file.

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
